      "content": {
        "heading": "The Campaign",
        "text": "The project included a multi-faceted campaign stretching across multiple months - starting with various street art interventions, a campaign film and ending with a large art exhibition in downtown Kuala Lumpur. A series of public murals was created to alert people about the imminent haze, featuring artworks from artists Fahmi Reza, Cloakwork, Pangrok Sulap, and Ernest Zacharevic.",
