      "content": {
        "image": {
          "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6465c08bc2eb8d26649eade8/65e72cb41cefcfe820a0df07_haze.streetArt.bg.jpg",
          "alt": ""
        },
        "parts": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "heading": "Street Art",
            "body": "Leading up to the exhibition, a series of creative interventions by artists Cloakwork, Pangrok Sulap and Ernest Zacharevic were held across areas of Kuala Lumpur and Penang. These pieces are part of a larger movement to sound the alarm on the recurring haze pollution and to demand urgent action.\n\n‍"
          },
          {
