    {
      "id": "text-15",
      "type": "text",
      "content": {
        "heading": "Creative Activism",
        "body": "The exhibition included a panel discussion on the topic of haze pollution and creative activism. The panel was moderated by environmental activist Melissa Tan, and invited environmentalists and creatives to share their insights. An interpretive dance about the haze was performed by Asia Ballet Academy."
      },
